WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.828
The right hand in the left hand.

2
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:10.320
And you're going to place it like a sword there, in the belly.

3
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.290
Like this, here, there, exactly.

4
00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:14.740
To have control here over the hara.

5
00:00:55.515 --> 00:00:57.870
And you're going to start by breathing into your belly.

6
00:01:00.331 --> 00:01:04.211
So I'm going to take a breath, I'm going to exhale through my mouth, like this.

7
00:01:04.211 --> 00:01:06.781
I hold my breath for 10 seconds, on the exhale.

8
00:01:06.781 --> 00:01:08.601
And then, I inhale like that.

9
00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:11.381
Now, you need to practice this exercise 3 times, 30 times.

10
00:01:11.381 --> 00:01:13.441
You'll have to increase it over time.

11
00:01:13.441 --> 00:01:16.232
You can go up to one to two minutes without breathing.

